<title>UK: RALLYING-BRITISH RAC RALLY RESULTS.</title>
<headline>RALLYING-BRITISH RAC RALLY RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>CHESTER, England 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading results of the</p>
<p>British RAC Rally after three days (27 stages):</p>
<p>1. Armin Schwarz (Germany) Toyota four hours 46 minutes</p>
<p>and 50 seconds</p>
<p>2. Masao Kamioka (Japan) Subaru seven minutes 52</p>
<p>seconds behind</p>
<p> 3. Stig Blomqvist (Sweden) Skoda		  15.12</p>
<p> 4. Mark Higgins (Britain) Nissan		  22.21</p>
<p> 5. Gregoire de Mevius (Belgium) Renault	 24.30</p>
<p> 6. Jeremy Easson (Britain) Ford		   27.09</p>
</text>
